  "description": "Honestly, Nevermind is the seventh studio album by Canadian rapper and singer Drake, which was surprise-released on June 17, 2022, through OVO Sound and Republic Records. The album includes a sole guest feature from 21 Savage, and production from a variety of producers, including Gordo, &Me, Rampa, and Black Coffee, who served as one of its executive producers. It is the second installment of what Drake described as a \"trilogy of albums\", following Certified Lover Boy (2021) and preceding Her Loss (2022).",
